      "label": "About this template",
      "s": {
        "text": "This searches the largest dispatch of Generator A for which the frequency after the contingency unit trips stays above the UFLS level (1 Hz below nominal, set on Frequency nadir), by halving the gap between a passing and a failing dispatch. Find limit reads UFLS at the end of each try (FALSE passes); a try whose load flow does not converge, or whose simulation stops early, counts as a fail. Fill in the project, Generator A (it can be the contingency unit itself), the contingency unit, the busbar on Run RMS simulation and the dispatch range."
      },
      "pin": [],
      "sv": 1
    },
